	"claim_results": [
		{
			"id": "R5-Lean-semantic-v2",
			"reason": "Independently checked all 22 definitions and 37 theorem declarations against the unchanged source, elaborated expressions, contract, supplied blind readback and relevant analytic context. The carrier and scalars are real; differentiation, evaluation, kernels, algebraic spans and matrix multiplication use the actual exported Polynomial, Submodule, LinearMap and Matrix operations. For m>=2, the lower exponents give zero traces, m-1 is nonzero, and the residue formulas cancel exactly. Total definitions at m=0,1 do not extend these assertions to invalid family indices. Every natural cutoff selects all qualifying indices, with no finite upper bound; linearity proves the span inclusions. The polynomial 1+X has traces (1,1) and zero residues, supplying strictness for every cutoff, while 1 and X fail the oblique condition. The determinant is 2L^2 for all natural L; invertibility requires L>0, and identification with monomial residue columns additionally requires Even L. The endpoint correction consequently has zero residues for positive even L. Divisibility preservation correctly has neither restriction. At L=0 the correction coefficients vanish, without an asserted inverse or general residue correction. The affine trace lift is a right inverse with zero residues, and membership reduction explicitly requires zero_traces<=W. The root contains eight substantive conjuncts and no outer assumption of its conclusion. The correspondence covers local real-polynomial algebra only.",
			"verdict": "APPROVED"
		},
		{
			"id": "R5-independent-execution-and-scope",
			"reason": "Passed within COORDINATOR_ATTESTED_TOOL_TRANSCRIPT scope. All 108 supplied snapshot hashes matched, including a final recheck. Spawn, steering and completion records consistently identify verifier 01a0c260-fa2c-71f1-aa9a-8ccfdf5befc5, distinct from every listed author, with fork_context=false and explicit manifest-bounded runtime permission. The recorded executor compiled source 035043c154c215e995a210b798f80cf131414eee5529ad54396a5af3d669ae45 into its fresh root object 59448f94c4791e647b2ec7a541519415390458d1a95e164fc802fa07499eb59e. Eight compiler receipts, their stream hashes, source/object bindings, command summaries and combined execution transcript agree. Root compilation, export, positive controls and exact eight-conjunct contract exit 0; the negative exits 1 specifically because strict inclusion is supplied where equality is required. The positive source compiles the explicit witness and universal inequality. Independent traversal reproduced all 59 exported dependency and axiom closures: 12,604 union nodes, 12,601 root nodes, 2,347 semantic nodes, only propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound, and no missing, sorryAx or unsafe nodes. Reconstructed statement and definition files match the supplied exports exactly. Before/after rehash records cover all 11 runtime files and 14,845 manifest artifacts and bracket execution; every recorded digest and size matches its manifest. The original root is hashed but excluded from import lookup; the loaded-module inventory resolves SL.AuditRound5 to the fresh object and all other modules to declared paths. Exporter adaptation is exactly the disclosed output-folder substitution, with no comparison-field relaxation. Archive and checksum bindings are consistent, including hash-matched reconstruction of two omitted baseline copies. The supplied separate execution record remedies the prior missing-independent-executor gap within this expressly limited receipt-review scope.",
